## Where it stands

Model building, evaluation, differentiation to second order, and the structural readers
(least-squares layout, Fisher information) are built and tested. Complete estimators and
samplers built on top of them (a damped Fisher-scoring loop, MCMC) are not built yet. See
[Status and roadmap](../../reference/status/) for the gap list.

